# /etc/inittab of midgard's Alpine image (busybox init, which midgard-init executes as
# PID 1 after it mounted the API file systems). OpenRC starts the services of the
# runlevels; then midgard-helper tells midgard-agent that the guest booted
# (`ready = "notify"`), which runs /etc/midgard/user-setup then.
::sysinit:/sbin/openrc sysinit
::sysinit:/sbin/openrc boot
::wait:/sbin/openrc default
::wait:/run/midgard/midgard-helper ready
::ctrlaltdel:/sbin/reboot
::shutdown:/sbin/openrc shutdown
